      "promptText": "Evaluate the limit. Enter DNE only if it does not exist.", "promptTex": "\\lim_{y \\to 1}\\frac{y^3-y}{y^2-1}", "answerText": "Factor the numerator and denominator, then cancel the common factors.", "answerTex": "\\frac{y(y-1)(y+1)}{(y-1)(y+1)}=y\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad 1",
